## Tests that are refused, and what replaces each one

The sentence speaks of lines being owed and states no number, which is the shape
this list carried before anything read it.

- A test that reads a document and believes it. Replaced by
  `RefusedTestsTests`.
- A test that has not been decided yet. Owed by #46.

Several of these are still owed, so for that much of its length this list is a
plan rather than a record.

